OL,3,GNEWSABingo caller reveals what it takes
OL,4,Ato be Britain's best                   
OL,6,FA bingo caller from Merseyside has won 
OL,7,Fa national title after 30 years in the 
OL,8,Findustry.                              
OL,10,FAnton Fletcher, who works at Castle    
OL,11,FBingo in Bootle, was named National    
OL,12,FBingo Game Caller of the Year 2026 at a
OL,13,Fcompetition in Leeds.                  
OL,15,FThe former Butlin's Redcoat said judges
OL,16,Fpraised him for getting players        
OL,17,Finvolved by walking through the hall   
OL,18,Fwhile calling numbers.                 
OL,20,FFletcher said his theatre background   
OL,21,Fhelped him project his voice and keep  
OL,22,Fplayers engaged.                       
